      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> Did you know that many people automatically accept vote kicks simply because they see them?\n\nHonestly I don't think I've ever seen a vote kick actually succeed, some times I try and find the person being vote kicked, but like if people are just blindly agreeing with vote kicks the solution there is for vrchat to occasionally show a vote kick for the user themselves and see if they are kicking themselves. Keep things silly, well, vrchat can't do that...\n\nBut yeah, if I'm ever in an instance where there is enough people voting to kick me, and they do, I don't know that I'm losing out on going somewhere else.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-05-12T05:05:42.723Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's time for the \"vote kick\" feature to disappear forever.  This system is abused by random people every single day.  I've literally watched as innocent people are helplessly kicked for no reason (ex: vote kick this guy cause he's a furry!).  This is putting power in the hands of trolls and cliques and it's been out of control for far too long.  With group publics now in VRChat, we simply don't need vote kick any more.\n\n  Did you know that many people automatically accept vote kicks simply because they see them?  Stuff like this leads way to abusing the system.  There are already enough tools at our disposal to deal with individuals.  A person shouldn't be removed from the lobby just because some people don't like what they're saying.  If they have a problem with an individual, they can mute, block, or report.  Vote kicking doesn't solve the problem anyway because the kicked person can simply do the same thing in another lobby.\n\n  Vote kick has absolutely no place on a SOCIAL PLATFORM.  Please get rid of it.",
